<title>USA: TENNIS-AMELIA ISLAND WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMELIA ISLAND WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMELIA ISLAND, Florida 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bausch &amp; Lomb Championships women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 12-Amanda Coetzer (South</p>
<p>Africa) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>11-Mary Pierce (France) beat 8-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 2-6 7-5</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
